_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541107012:1":{"text":"맞는 말이네요.","source_cn":"你说的没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1325A0C21EFA6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541107013:1":{"text":"그럼 미래의 마법사 협회 차석은 “모르간”이라는 이름을 이어받나요?","source_cn":"那么，未来魔法师协会的第二席，是否会继承“摩根”这个称号呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65138E638C18009F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541107014:1":{"text":"됐어. 난 계승자 따위 필요 없으니까.","source_cn":"算了吧，我可不想有继承人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E9E0603F75DE680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"네가 너를 멀린이라고 소개했을 때, 나도 놀랐어","source_cn":"我第一次听到你自称梅林时也很惊讶","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xACB8318265B20905","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 너를 멀린이라고 소개했을 때, 나도 놀랐어","female":"네가 너를 멀린이라고 소개했을 때, 나도 놀랐어","variant_male_record_index":"78709","variant_female_record_index":"78710","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"이게 바로 운명이야!","source_cn":"这就是命运！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x698B9C7516055CE4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이게 바로 운명이야!","female":"이게 바로 운명이야!","variant_male_record_index":"78711","variant_female_record_index":"78712","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit